WEBVTT

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:09.780
Flowers! So pretty!

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.400
Cordelia-san!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.860
Wait!

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.370
Take us with you!

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.950
Let's all go to a beautiful place!

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.960
Wait!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.990
Nero...

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.790
Rock, paper, scissors...

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:15.300
That was a good sleep.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.010
Me too. Pleasant sleep!

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:23.770
My night got ruined, though. Nero, your sleeping posture is really bad.

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:25.350
Huh? What's this now?

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:31.190
You're one to talk, Cordelia. You keep taking up our space.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.530
Hey, I've never done that before!

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:36.740
You keep kicking our faces. That's just wrong!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.530
It's not like having a foot in your face would kill you, would it?

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:42.910
It could! Like I'm saying, stop kicking our faces!

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:45.700
I'll do whatever I want, neener-neener!

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.040
What do you mean!?

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.960
In the first place, your feet keep going in my space, too!

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.000
Liar!

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.260
I can tell by the smell. No one else's feet stink like that!

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:56.840
That's the "fragrance of flowers" to you!

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:01.220
Now, now. You just both have bad sleeping postures, that's all.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.220
We don't want to hear that from you!

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:06.100
I slept right away, too!

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.020
I was being careful even in my sleep!

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:11.150
I haven't fallen off the bed once!

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:12.520
You're full of crap!

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:15.230
Um, we're late...

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:17.400
Herc, you get in the way too at night.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.400
Yeah!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:19.660
No way...

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:23.080
<i>What're they doing at this hour?</i>

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:25.870
<i>Well, not like it matters to me.</i>

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:31.790
So you skipped classes because of your shouting match in the cafeteria?

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.000
Is that it?

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.920
It's Cordelia's fault!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:36.960
It's yours, Nero!

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:38.470
It's mine...

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.510
The bell didn't ring!

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:42.640
Really!

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:47.440
Actually, isn't it weird that there's classes at this time of day?

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:48.640
Silence!

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:54.400
You've forgotten your duties as detectives and as students. What are you doing!?

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.730
Uh...

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:59.860
You have no reason to exist right now.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:02.320
Even the mold in bread is more useful than you lot!

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.630
Mold!!

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:20.800
You're wrong!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.850
I just mispronounced "cold", I swear!!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:25.970
Get out.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:31.100
That was an order from Henriette-sama. Begone!

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.100
Don't be so stupid!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.730
Whenever my beautiful classes take place, it's showtime!

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.490
As for you grotesque ones...

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.900
No showtime!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:44.320
My word.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.700
Man, they're so useless.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:52.210
Actually, moldy mold. Moldy mold of the moldy mold, Moldy Holmes!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:59.340
Have you prepared for tonight's heist?

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.260
Uh... Um...

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.470
Well...

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.840
We're about to...

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.010
Then snap to it!

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:05.720
Yes'm!

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:14.440
Perhaps the time to leave this place is coming soon...

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.440
Henriette-san's been kinda weird lately.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.690
Yes...

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:24.860
She's always in a fit when we see her. Maybe she needs calcium?

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:25.490
Right...

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:29.030
But yeah, we can't stay like this.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:31.950
She's right to get mad.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.080
We've gotta do something!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.920
Do what, though?

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.670
Ah! I've got it!

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:42.510
Everything will be solved once we fix our sleeping postures!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:50.510
Um, I've been reading a book recently...

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:51.970
Yeah?

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:58.110
It says that to fix our sleeping postures, we must be relaxed going to sleep...

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.570
Really?

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.480
That's our Herc-san!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:08.910
Um, I think it said that we've got to forget about work and studies before bed...

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:11.700
Studies? What's that?

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:12.620
What was it?

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.250
What is that?

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.210
Uh...

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.540
"Work" means detective work, right?

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.880
Ah, that's it!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.960
Okay, let's start by forgetting about being detectives!

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.550
Yup, time to not think about being detectives!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:30.430
Don't think, don't think, don't think...

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:34.560
Nero, saying it out loud actually makes it worse.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.940
That's not good! We've gotta forget about work!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.770
Ahh...

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:42.940
<i>All-you-can-eat fish paste!</i>

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:48.570
<i>Yum-yum!</i>

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.910
This is kind of hard...

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.790
We just end up thinking about being detectives.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:58.370
Eh? Really?

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:02.420
Man, our heads get too full of other stuff.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.630
Herc, isn't there another way?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.630
Games...

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:07.170
A game!

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.220
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:12.600
I'm first!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.060
Here I go!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:17.640
Already!?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.730
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.770
Me first again!

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:27.190
You can't take ones from the top!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:32.240
This hurts! I want to play!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:38.080
Sweet! You're up, Cordelia!

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.460
Right!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.290
This one...

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.300
What are you doing!?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.300
I was just breathing.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.170
Jeez...

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:58.600
Cordelia-san lost!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.900
The loser does whatever the winner says!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:05.860
Eh? No fair, Sher didn't need to do that!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.690
I just decided it. C'mon, wear this.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:11.570
Ugh, fine.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:13.990
Tada!

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:22.750
"I'm the Phantom Thief, Arsène. I've come again tonight to steal treasure!"

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:28.010
Amazing! The boing-boing is moving!

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.380
C-Cordelia...

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.920
She's grown so much...

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:33.720
Huh?

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.640
That was Kamaboko!?

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:41.060
Well, Cordelia's not that well-endowed yet.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.810
She's still basically a washboard.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:48.440
Oh? I think I'm still bigger than you here, Nero.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.740
But I suppose children like you wouldn't understand.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:56.620
So what, you're the adult or something? You're totally unreliable!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:58.090
What was that!?

00:07:58.090 --> 00:07:59.950
Cordelia's boobs are still a kid's!

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:03.370
Kamaboko, that tickles!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.500
Let's go prove it, then!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:08.750
You little...!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.840
What did you say!?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:24.650
Breaking news: Phantom Thief Arsène and company have stolen a national treasure, the "Break It And You'll Be Sorry" vase!

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.690
Hold it, Phantom Thief Empire!

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.860
You won't get away!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:37.070
Stop! Give back the vase! Hey, hold it, Arsène!

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:41.160
<i>Milky Holmes as of late is just unbelievable.</i>

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:45.080
<i>They don't even pay heed to reports of phantom thieves.</i>

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.380
You little...!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:52.420
Step on it, will ya!? How can humans outrun a speeding helicopter!?

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:56.180
We're currently moving at top speed, ma'am!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.010
We could go faster if we use our reserve engine.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:01.600
I want to go down there and fight.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.810
You're gonna jump!?

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:06.020
Their bullets aren't hitting us at all!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.650
If they do, you'll repent!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.070
Bullets! Bullets!

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:13.820
Ow!

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:19.070
There!

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:20.780
Have some of this!

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.840
We're sorry!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.170
Geez, shape up!

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.470
This is why your IQ is third rate!

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.010
Arsène!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:48.600
You will never get away from Akechi Kokoro, the genius girl with a pretty face and an IQ of 140,000!

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:52.820
Give back the "Break It And You'll Be Sorry!" vase!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.820
I shall give it back, then.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:09.460
Splendid.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.420
That was close...

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.460
You're too much for us.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.670
Panties visibility, 100%.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.760
The vase is fine, so whatever!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.720
That one is a fake, though.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:22.760
Huh?

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.600
What the!?

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:36.230
Hey!!

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:39.820
Thieves all start out as liars!

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:42.570
Are you listening, Arsène!?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:48.160
<i>Even if I play with the police, it won't satisfy me.</i>

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:01.300
Hey, your butt is going on my side, Cordelia!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.840
Huh? What now?

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:03.680
This.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.600
W-What's this!?

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:06.890
My area.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.140
Oh, your hair is crossing it!

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.350
Fine, hundred yen!

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:13.860
H-Hey, your cowlick is hanging over my area too!

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.360
Overhead is fine!

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.860
In the air is no good either!

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:18.570
Where's your proof, then?

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.320
Right, we can't be late again!

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:27.490
Huh? What're you reading, Herc-san?

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:32.000
Um, a story my stepmother and I read together...

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.210
Really?

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:35.210
Please read it to me sometime!

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:36.880
Y-Yes...

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:41.220
Jeez, I can't sleep any more with Cordelia!

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.510
Let's change our positions!

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:45.510
It's always like this...

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:47.680
Now this!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.980
It's a little different, so it's kind of refreshing!

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.770
Right, Kamaboko?

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:02.740
I can rest easy tonight knowing I'm not next to Cordelia.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.240
You took the words right out of my mouth.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.620
Okay, good night!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.290
Night.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:35.100
Flowerbed!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:43.070
I don't get to be bothered by Nero's feet today!

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:04.090
Listen up. Cordelia is invading our territory and trying to turn it into a stinky flowerbed.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.220
Unforgivable, right?

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:08.680
Okay, go!

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.150
Ew!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.780
Cordeliaaaah!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.750
What're you doing!?

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:01.480
From the attic?

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:10.370
Kamaboko, so yummy...

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:17.210
Yay, all-you-can-eat fish paste!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:22.340
Sherlock, these cheese fish pastes are good too.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:26.670
Ooh, cheese with fish paste! Genius!

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.680
Delicious!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:35.180
Sherlock, here's some aged cheese for you!

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:37.810
Ah! Kokoro-chan, thank you!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:38.560
Geez...

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.900
Don't-call-me-Kokoro-chan~

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.040
Today's work is also...

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.410
Smoking!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.830
Smoking! Smoking!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:07.460
<i>But being stared at by this many people is too embarrassing!</i>

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:17.470
I can rest easy now...

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.140
Milky Holmes, you're making a racket.

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:25.360
Snap out of it, Kamaboko!

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:26.650
What're you doing!?

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:29.950
My... My...!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.580
Nerooooh...

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.830
Cordeliaaaah!

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:47.750
Pillow Missile~

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:58.970
Do whatever you want with me...

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:02.230
I will sacrifice myself to save the lives of innocent people!

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:08.570
No... Not a sacrifice!

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:26.790
Don't call me Kokoro-chan!

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:30.760
Sherlock, hurry up and eat. If you don't...

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:35.140
It will get moldy. Like you.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:38.260
I don't want that!

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:41.180
Moldy Sherlock! Moldy Sherlock!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.440
No, not moldy...

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:54.700
Just to let you know, your model pictures have been published!

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:01.580
I didn't pose nude...

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:06.210
Just looking at you wearing a curtain gave us all the inspiration we needed!

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:08.460
See, they're all looking at you!

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:09.340
Eh!?

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:18.550
It's smoking, no matter how often I look at it! I can't get enough of this!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:25.230
Smoking! Smoking! Smoking!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.560
Stop it...

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.400
Stop it!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:36.200
Stop it...

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.700
Nero, let go of my hand!

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.920
Save yourself!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:48.670
What're you saying!?

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:52.460
Cordelia, you're... You're like...

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:56.220
Like a dear sister to me! Like I could just abandon you!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.590
Nero!

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:05.850
After you just said that!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.020
But you said to let go!

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:45.600
My body hurts all over...

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.730
Me too. It's like my back is all bent...

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:51.440
My face isn't looking too well from lack of sleep...

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.480
Why were only you sleeping on the bed, Herc?

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.280
Yeah, why?

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:59.530
I don't remember anything...

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:05.870
I think that we should sleep in our usual positions as always...

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.710
Um, we're going to be late soon...

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.920
Ah! We can't be late today!

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.790
We promised Henriette-san!

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.920
Hurry, hurry!

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.090
Oh, I've got it!

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:22.010
Maybe the one with the worst sleeping posture is Herc-san!

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:26.220
You're right. She knocked everyone else off the bed!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.140
Yay, I feel like a detective right now!

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:36.940
<i>I've decided to wait for your revival.</i>

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:38.780
<i>But only...</i>

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:42.990
<i>Only for a little longer.</i>

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:49.130
My name is Hercule Barton.

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:50.710
Eh? Hobby?

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:53.170
I like reading books.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:57.210
Um, Yokohama's <i>Dengeki Dash!</i>  anthology,

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.710
Isezaki District's <i>Skin Seishi</i> series,

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:03.340
and <i>Katei Medicine</i>  are all titles I found interesting.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:06.930
Next time: Stealthy Preparations.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:10.520
The culprit is the episode's main character, my stepsister.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:13.520
Oh, and some mystery, too...
